---
import ProjectsIcon from '../assets/icons/solid/projects.svg';
---

<section class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
  <div class="card-body">
    <h2 class="card-title text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <ProjectsIcon
        class="h-7 w-7 shrink-0 fill-primary"
        aria-label="Projects icon"
      />
      Projects
    </h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-4">
      <!-- Cohesity & Veritas Technologies -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-3">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content">
            Cohesity & Veritas Technologies
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 italic">
            December 2024 - Present | August 2020 - December 2024
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-base font-semibold">System Health Insights</h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-base-content/80">
                Analytics Dashboard with Frontend Leadership
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              Led the frontend architecture and development of a comprehensive
              analytics dashboard that provides real-time system health
              monitoring for enterprise appliance customers. The platform
              enables proactive issue detection and performance optimization
              across distributed systems.
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
              <li>
                Architected scalable frontend using Angular 12+ with modular
                component design
              </li>
              <li>
                Implemented real-time data visualization with interactive charts
                and metrics
              </li>
              <li>
                Led frontend technical decisions and established coding
                standards for the team
              </li>
              <li>
                Designed responsive UI supporting multiple device types and
                screen sizes
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-2">
              <strong>Tech Stack:</strong> Angular, TypeScript, RxJS, NgRx, RESTful
              APIs
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-base font-semibold">
                Support Engineer Triage Application
              </h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-base-content/80">
                Full-Stack Debugging Platform
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              Designed and built an end-to-end web application to streamline the
              customer defect debugging process for support engineers. The tool
              significantly reduced triage time by centralizing logs, metrics,
              and diagnostic information in a unified interface.
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
              <li>
                Developed complete full-stack solution from UX mockups to
                production deployment
              </li>
              <li>
                Created intuitive frontend interface for quick access to
                critical debugging data
              </li>
              <li>
                Built robust backend APIs for aggregating data from multiple
                sources
              </li>
              <li>
                Improved support team efficiency with automated log parsing and
                issue classification
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-2">
              <strong>Tech Stack:</strong> Angular, Node.js, TypeScript, Express.js,
              RESTful APIs
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-base font-semibold">
                Release Management Automation
              </h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-base-content/80">
                CLI Tool for Microservices Deployment
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              Built a command-line automation tool that orchestrates release
              management across 25+ microservices, reducing deployment
              complexity and human error in the release process.
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
              <li>
                Automated version bumping, changelog generation, and dependency
                updates
              </li>
              <li>
                Integrated with CI/CD pipelines for seamless deployment
                workflows
              </li>
              <li>
                Reduced release cycle time by 70% through intelligent automation
              </li>
              <li>
                Implemented rollback mechanisms and deployment validation checks
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-2">
              <strong>Tech Stack:</strong> Node.js, TypeScript, CLI frameworks, Git
              APIs
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Ecozen Solutions -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-3">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content">
            Ecozen Solutions
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 italic">
            September 2019 - August 2020
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-base font-semibold">IoT Analytics Dashboard</h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-base-content/80">
                Real-Time Monitoring Platform
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              Developed a comprehensive web dashboard for monitoring and
              managing agricultural IoT devices deployed across multiple farms.
              The platform provided real-time insights into device performance,
              environmental conditions, and operational metrics.
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
              <li>
                Built responsive dashboard using Vue.js with real-time data
                updates
              </li>
              <li>
                Implemented interactive visualizations for sensor data from 100+
                devices
              </li>
              <li>
                Designed user-friendly interface for non-technical farm
                operators
              </li>
              <li>
                Integrated live alerting system for critical device conditions
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-2">
              <strong>Tech Stack:</strong> Vue.js, JavaScript, RESTful APIs, WebSockets
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-base font-semibold">
                MQTT Client & Data Pipeline
              </h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-base-content/80">
                IoT Data Processing Solution
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              Engineered a robust data ingestion and processing system for
              handling real-time data streams from IoT devices, ensuring
              reliable storage and quick retrieval for analytics.
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
              <li>Developed MQTT client for real-time device communication</li>
              <li>
                Built ETL pipeline for parsing, validating, and storing sensor
                data
              </li>
              <li>
                Implemented automated monitoring with email notifications for
                device anomalies
              </li>
              <li>Designed time-series data storage strategy in MongoDB</li>
              <li>
                Created CRON jobs for scheduled data processing and maintenance
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-2">
              <strong>Tech Stack:</strong> Node.js, TypeScript, MQTT, MongoDB, Express.js
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Advinans -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-3">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content">Advinans</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 italic">
            September 2018 - August 2019
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-base font-semibold">
                Kubernetes Deployment Automation
              </h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-base-content/80">
                Slack-Integrated DevOps Bot
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              Created an intelligent Slack bot that revolutionized the team's
              deployment workflow by enabling developers to deploy Docker
              containers to Kubernetes clusters directly from Slack
              conversations.
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
              <li>
                Reduced deployment time from 30 minutes to under 2 minutes
              </li>
              <li>
                Implemented serverless deployment logic using Google Cloud
                Functions
              </li>
              <li>
                Built secure authentication and authorization for deployment
                commands
              </li>
              <li>
                Integrated with Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE) for zero-downtime
                deployments
              </li>
              <li>
                Improved developer experience with simple, intuitive Slack
                commands
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-2">
              <strong>Tech Stack:</strong> TypeScript, Google Cloud Functions, Kubernetes,
              Docker, GCP, Slack API
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TallBird Employment Innovations -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-3">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content">
            TallBird Employment Innovations
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 italic">
            January 2018 - August 2018
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-base font-semibold">
                Progressive Web Application
              </h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-base-content/80">
                Modern HR Platform
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              Built a high-performance Progressive Web Application for the HR
              technology space, delivering app-like experiences with web
              technologies.
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
              <li>
                Achieved 90+ Lighthouse score across performance, accessibility,
                and best practices
              </li>
              <li>
                Implemented offline capabilities using service workers and
                caching strategies
              </li>
              <li>
                Integrated push notifications for real-time user engagement
              </li>
              <li>
                Designed responsive, mobile-first UI with modern design
                principles
              </li>
              <li>
                Delivered fast, reliable experience across all devices and
                network conditions
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-2">
              <strong>Tech Stack:</strong> React.js, Service Workers, Web App Manifest,
              JavaScript
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-base font-semibold">
                Serverless Backend Architecture
              </h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-base-content/80">
                Firebase-Powered Infrastructure
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              Architected and implemented a complete serverless backend
              infrastructure, eliminating the need for traditional server
              management while ensuring scalability and real-time capabilities.
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
              <li>Built business logic using Firebase Cloud Functions</li>
              <li>
                Implemented real-time data synchronization with Cloud Firestore
              </li>
              <li>
                Designed secure authentication and authorization workflows
              </li>
              <li>Created RESTful API endpoints for mobile and web clients</li>
              <li>
                Achieved automatic scaling with zero infrastructure management
                overhead
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-2">
              <strong>Tech Stack:</strong> Firebase, Cloud Functions, Cloud Firestore,
              Node.js, JavaScript
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
